# Wildfire Howl {1}{R}{R} with the gift, aimed at Bot2's Wall of Stone, which Bot2 exiles with Swords to Plowshares in response (CR 608.2b; ruling 2024-07-26): the only target is illegal, so the spell doesn't resolve - no creature is damaged
# (Bot1's Ornithopter survives) and the gift is never given, so Bot2 draws no card (its hand is 3 before Swords, 2 after).

